      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the suggestions. i checked for aphids but didnt really see much. the holes are super small, almost like tiny pinpricks. it's weird because i've also noticed some of the soil looks disturbed, like little clumps of dirt have been moved around near the base of the plants. could it be something living in the soil or maybe something that comes out at night? it's so hard to catch them in the act.",
